  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large skillet over medium high heat.",
    "Add the beef strips and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped shiso leaves, garlic free seasoning, tomato paste, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to medium low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional shiso leaves if desired.",
    "Refrigerate or freeze leftovers for up to 3 days.",
    "Reheat gently before serving."
  ],
